{"created": "2026-10-24T19:32:47.684964+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-24T19:32:48.119644+00:00", "id": 23624433, "conceptrecid": "23624432", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23624433", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23624432", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23624433", "metadata": {"title": "Two-strip square packings: improved upper bounds for s(n), n = 1184\u20133775", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23624433", "publication_date": "2026-10-24", "description": "<p>683 new upper bounds for packing n unit squares in a square (1184 &le; n &le; 3775); 85 of them improve on the trivial grid &lceil;&radic;n&rceil;. Karimi two-strip construction: two low-angle strips of tilted squares attached to the walls (one on the bottom wall, one on the right wall), the rest an axis-parallel grid. All angles have rational tan(&theta;/2), so every certificate is exact (rational coordinates); each passes the exact verifier of Mishapolk/square-packing-records. records.csv lists the new and previous sides and the construction parameters; regenerate.py rebuilds every certificate exactly. Code and computations were done with the assistance of Claude (Anthropic) under the author's direction.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Karimi, Mohsen", "affiliation": "Independent researcher, Zanjan, Iran", "orcid": "0009-0004-1055-8267"}], "keywords": ["square packing", "packing unit squares", "upper bounds", "discrete geometry", "experimental mathematics"], "version": "V1.0", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": false, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23624432"}}]}}, "title": "Two-strip square packings: improved upper bounds for s(n), n = 1184\u20133775", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624433", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23624433", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23624433?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23624433", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23624433", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23624433", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624433/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624432", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23624432", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23624432", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23624432", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23624433/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23624433/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624433/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624433/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624433/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23624433/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624433/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624433/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624433/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624433/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624433/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624433/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624433/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624433/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624433/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624433/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624433/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624433/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23624433/requests"}, "updated": "2026-10-24T19:32:48.119644+00:00", "recid": "23624433", "revision": 3, "files": [{"id": "71b3b9fd-37de-4afd-91d2-5dc40529583e", "key": "karimi_two_strip_records_v1_lite.zip", 